```plaintext
---
Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
---
@prefix : <http://example.org/autonomous-driving#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

# Entities
:Scene1 a :Scene ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :FoggyWeather ;
    :hasRoadCondition :WetRoad .

:FoggyWeather a :WeatherCondition ;
    :visibilityRange "low" ;
    :hasPrecipitation "none" .

:WetRoad a :RoadCondition ;
    :surfaceCondition "wet" .

:Vehicle1 a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "autonomous" ;
    :position "front" ;
    :hasDriver "none" ;
    :hasObstruction :WindshieldObstruction .

:WindshieldObstruction a :Obstruction ;
    :type "water" ;
    :location :Windshield .

:Vehicle2 a :Vehicle ;
    :vehicleType "truck" ;
    :position "distance" ;
    :direction "approaching" .

:Pedestrian1 a :Pedestrian ;
    :position "sidewalk" ;
    :action "running" ;
    :direction "crossing" .

:SoccerBall a :Object ;
    :type "sportsBall" ;
    :position "road" .

# Relationships
:Vehicle1 :hasVisibilityRelation :Pedestrian1 ;
    :visibilityStatus "reduced" .

:Vehicle1 :hasVisibilityRelation :SoccerBall ;
    :visibilityStatus "reduced" .

:Vehicle1 :hasObstructionRelation :WindshieldObstruction ;
    :obstructionImpact "high" .

:Pedestrian1 :hasMovementRelation :Vehicle1 ;
    :movementType "crossing" ;
    :movementDirection "towards" .

:Vehicle2 :hasMovementRelation :Vehicle1 ;
    :movementType "following" .

---
Identified Risks for each risk class
---

Risk 1:
Description: Reduced visibility due to fog and water on windshield obstructing the driver's view of the soccer ball and pedestrian.
Severity Score: 0.9
    - Justification: High risk due to the combination of low visibility and potential for unexpected pedestrian movement.

Risk 2:
Description: Wet road conditions increasing the risk of hydroplaning or reduced braking efficiency for :Vehicle1.
Severity Score: 0.7
    - Justification: Wet roads generally pose a moderate to high risk for vehicle control and braking.

Risk 3:
Description: Pedestrian crossing the road unexpectedly while :Vehicle1 has reduced visibility.
Severity Score: 0.95
    - Justification: High risk due to the pedestrian's unpredictable movement and the vehicle's limited visibility.

Risk 4:
Description: Potential for the soccer ball to roll onto the road and obstruct traffic or cause an accident.
Severity Score: 0.6
    - Justification: Moderate risk as the soccer ball could be a sudden obstacle, but less immediate than the pedestrian.

---
```